      },
      {
        "_uid": "359620b2-34de-32fe-c232-85e62a388854",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "For patients, the minimally invasive surgery, means safer and more precise surgeries with less complications, faster recovery times and improved health outcomes. \n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Synaptive Medical's President Cameron Piron said that the system is a GPS of sorts for the brain, which gives surgeons a visual representation of the complex structures of the brain.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"For us, this system is a first step towards the establishment of a Centre of Excellence in Neurosciences at AKUH, which will provide comprehensive and quality care for all diseases related to the nervous system and spine,\" said Aga Khan University's President Firoz Rasul. \"Our vision is high quality healthcare covering the entire spectrum from technology and facilities to care.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
